# __BLOCK_NAME__ egress

Use deny-by-default outbound access when connecting this tool to an ACA Sandbox.
Add only the destinations required by the implemented operation. Do not pass
agent-host credentials, environment secrets, or host filesystem mounts.

`egress-policy.yaml` contains the ACA policy with `defaultAction: Deny`,
`trafficInspection: Full`, and optional proxy-side credential references.
Apply it with `aca sandbox egress apply` and verify platform decisions with
`aca sandbox egress decisions` before using untrusted input. The README lists
the commands. The container image does not configure Azure networking.
